/**
 * IPC type surface (stable import point for the whole frontend).
 *
 * CONTRACT: the shapes are SINGLE-SOURCED from Rust. Every interface here
 * is generated by ts-rs (`cargo test export_bindings` / `npm run gen:types`)
 * into `./gen/<RustTypeName>.ts` from the Rust definitions (primarily
 * `src-tauri/src/engine/types.rs`, plus the payload types declared next to
 * their commands/events) and re-exported below under the stable FE names —
 * including renames where the FE name differs (e.g. Rust `PtyOutput` is
 * exported as `PtyOutputEvent`). Never edit `./gen/*` by hand; never
 * hand-write a Rust-mirrored shape here. Changing a Rust type without
 * regenerating fails the CI drift gate.
 *
 * The only hand-written types are FE-only helpers (no Rust counterpart),
 * marked `// FE-only:` below.
 *
 * Wire format: snake_case field names end to end (values pass through
 * verbatim — no camelCase conversion anywhere); see docs/contracts.md.
 */

